@startuml
title Book Provider — sequence
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Provider Service" as Provider
participant "Booking Service" as Booking
participant "Availability Service" as Avail
database DB

User -> UI: Select provider + request quote
UI -> Provider: GET /api/v1/providers/{id}/availability
Provider -> Avail: check resources/calendar
Avail --> Provider: availability
Provider --> UI: quote + available slots
User -> UI: confirm booking (with budget)
UI -> Booking: POST /api/v1/providers/{id}/book
Booking -> Provider: reserve resources
Booking -> DB: create booking record
DB --> Booking: booking_id
Booking --> UI: 200 OK {booking_id}
UI -> User: show booking confirmation
Booking -> Notification: notify provider + organizer
@enduml